WEBVTT

00:05.467 --> 00:06.467
(♪ "Freeze Me Up" by SiM)

00:06.927 --> 00:11.547
(♪ singing in Japanese)

01:37.337 --> 01:39.507
[Amagi] I had originally
thought I'd be feasting

01:39.587 --> 01:40.927
on your powers by now.

01:41.967 --> 01:44.217
(Rago scoffs) Yeah,
that's a real shame.

01:44.507 --> 01:46.337
-(♪ gentle music)
-Had I done so, however,

01:49.087 --> 01:51.177
I suppose I wouldn't have had
this last chance

01:51.297 --> 01:52.297
to chat with you.

01:53.547 --> 01:56.467
Rago, do you have
any recollection

01:56.587 --> 01:58.387
of your first few moments
of your life?

01:58.637 --> 02:01.637
Huh? Who the hell remembers
the moment they were born?

02:01.757 --> 02:04.337
[Amagi] You happen to be
speaking to one who does.

02:04.467 --> 02:07.507
I remember everything
in detail, vividly.

02:07.637 --> 02:09.637
I'd just acquired
this physical form

02:09.757 --> 02:12.637
when I gazed upon a lonely
but radiant full moon

02:12.757 --> 02:15.507
set in the inky black
of the night sky.

02:15.637 --> 02:17.337
The concept of parents
and children

02:17.467 --> 02:19.467
isn't part of our existence.

02:19.587 --> 02:21.547
The winds carry
the stuff of life.

02:22.007 --> 02:24.507
Passion, hatred, daydreams.

02:24.967 --> 02:26.217
They drift and mingle

02:26.337 --> 02:29.177
then suddenly manifest
and materialize.

02:29.297 --> 02:31.547
That's how we mononoke
come into being.

02:32.007 --> 02:34.047
We are strangers
in a strange land,

02:34.177 --> 02:36.337
beings without a home or family.

02:36.467 --> 02:39.177
We are aberrations.
Freaks of nature.

02:40.137 --> 02:42.257
(stomach rumbles)

02:42.387 --> 02:43.387
(woman shrieks)

02:44.967 --> 02:47.427
(demon laughs)

02:47.547 --> 02:50.177
What a jewel of a
woman. (laughs)

02:50.297 --> 02:53.547
Please, I beg you.
Have mercy on my soul.

02:54.007 --> 02:56.467
Oh, no, don't you
fret, my beauty.

02:57.137 --> 02:58.837
Paradise awaits you!

03:01.427 --> 03:02.507
(Amagi sighs)

03:02.637 --> 03:05.217
Huh? Hey, who are you?

03:05.337 --> 03:07.467
[Amagi] He's my kind.
A mononoke.

03:08.047 --> 03:10.137
-(woman whimpers)
-Please, help me.

03:10.257 --> 03:11.837
[Amagi] Human.
Such weaklings.

03:13.087 --> 03:16.047
A pestering stranger
you are to me!

03:16.177 --> 03:18.427
You dare transgress
into my domain?

03:19.387 --> 03:21.837
Now, die!

03:23.297 --> 03:25.967
(insects chirp)

03:27.427 --> 03:29.177
[Amagi] My hunger's gone now.

03:29.297 --> 03:31.337
And my power's increased.

03:31.467 --> 03:33.587
But the flesh tastes rancid.

03:34.007 --> 03:35.137
Um...

03:36.547 --> 03:38.177
Please forgive me.

03:38.297 --> 03:40.547
I confess
that I know not your godly face.

03:41.007 --> 03:43.547
But you saved my life,
and for that I owe you deeply.

03:44.007 --> 03:46.587
So I praise thee with
all my might and humility.

03:47.217 --> 03:50.177
[Amagi] Mankind see
mononoke as gods.

03:50.797 --> 03:54.137
Please, may I be so honored
as to know thy name?

03:54.467 --> 03:57.757
-(♪ gentle music)
-You may call me...

03:57.887 --> 04:00.427
As if nature herself
had written it into law,

04:00.547 --> 04:03.387
I soon became a god worshipped
by the local village.

04:05.047 --> 04:07.177
[Villager] Lord Amagi, your
graciousness

04:07.297 --> 04:09.467
has brought peace
to this village.

04:09.587 --> 04:12.427
We ask that you please accept
our humble offering of thanks.

04:13.007 --> 04:14.217
(Amagi grunts)

04:14.337 --> 04:17.547
[Amagi] It was only later that
I learned the mononoke I had

04:17.677 --> 04:19.507
slain had
once been the villagers' deity.

04:19.637 --> 04:21.547
That ogre
had been an odious presence

04:22.007 --> 04:24.587
that cast a dark shadow
over their lives.

04:24.717 --> 04:27.427
His tyranny had
traumatized their souls.

04:27.547 --> 04:30.387
Fear tinged their awe
and veneration of me.

04:30.637 --> 04:32.427
They erected a shrine
in my honor

04:32.547 --> 04:35.087
and made regular offerings
of rice and sake.

04:35.547 --> 04:37.177
In return for their worship,

04:37.297 --> 04:38.427
I kept at bay the nearly

04:38.547 --> 04:40.087
countless threats
to the village.

04:40.507 --> 04:44.007
There were bandits,
rogue samurai, thieves,

04:44.137 --> 04:45.507
and other mononoke.

04:46.547 --> 04:50.047
I fought. I killed.
I was worshiped.

04:50.837 --> 04:53.587
My actions made
my position ironclad.

04:54.047 --> 04:56.637
To the villagers,
I had become the almighty.

04:57.757 --> 05:01.297
And in turn,
their devotion molded my psyche.

05:04.387 --> 05:08.137
Lord Amagi, if I may inquire,

05:08.257 --> 05:11.047
don't you desire the
nourishment of human flesh?

05:11.177 --> 05:12.217
Human flesh?

05:12.337 --> 05:14.297
The earlier deity was different.

05:14.427 --> 05:16.217
He had a hunger for maidens.

05:17.047 --> 05:18.507
Please forgive my insolence.

05:18.967 --> 05:21.927
I just, I cannot hide
my shameful curiosity.

05:22.297 --> 05:24.137
(Amagi grunts)

05:24.257 --> 05:25.717
It's true that to mononoke,

05:25.837 --> 05:27.887
there's nothing more restorative
than human flesh.

05:28.427 --> 05:29.547
It fortifies us.

05:30.007 --> 05:31.507
And the healing
effects it provides

05:31.637 --> 05:33.087
are almost instantaneous.

05:33.507 --> 05:35.177
However, my current tastes

05:35.297 --> 05:37.007
guide me away
from human sustenance

05:37.137 --> 05:38.217
and more toward rice and sake.

05:39.337 --> 05:42.047
Unless an urgent
need were to arise,

05:42.177 --> 05:44.257
(Amagi slurps)

05:44.387 --> 05:46.387
my diet should remain the same.

05:46.507 --> 05:48.337
I doubt it'll change.

05:48.467 --> 05:50.137
(woman sighs)

05:50.257 --> 05:52.337
I wasn't merely
feigning compassion,

05:52.467 --> 05:54.717
I really believed
what I said then.

05:54.837 --> 05:57.507
The id and ego of my
being were in flux.

05:57.637 --> 05:59.257
There was no black
or white anymore,

05:59.387 --> 06:01.177
only the gray of change.

06:02.087 --> 06:03.137
But that evening...

06:03.507 --> 06:05.337
[Villager] (gasp) Lord Amagi!

06:05.797 --> 06:08.717
Neighboring territories had
launched an organized attack.

06:08.837 --> 06:11.547
It was the first time I tasted
the bitterness of defeat.

06:12.047 --> 06:13.507
It shattered my confidence.

06:13.637 --> 06:15.507
My entire universe was shaken.

06:16.967 --> 06:19.427
I forced the enemy to retreat

06:19.547 --> 06:21.837
but regrettably,
they're unharmed.

06:22.297 --> 06:25.547
Come dawn, I suspect that they
will mount another offensive.

06:26.217 --> 06:28.427
In this condition, even I will-

06:28.547 --> 06:30.337
No, this can't be.

06:30.467 --> 06:33.217
Please, Elder, we must fight
alongside Lord Amagi!

06:33.337 --> 06:34.507
We lack the proper training.

06:34.637 --> 06:37.007
All that would happen is
we would fall as well.

06:37.137 --> 06:39.337
But if we all band together,
there's still a chance!

06:40.337 --> 06:42.137
[Amagi] They would fight
at my side.

06:42.257 --> 06:44.717
-We must fight, or
-[Amagi] We would join forces.

06:48.047 --> 06:49.507
[Elder] Gather
everyone together.

06:50.637 --> 06:52.507
-(♪ eerie tense music)
-(villager whimpers)

06:52.967 --> 06:57.137
Lord Amagi. Please, Lord.
Take this sacrifice.

06:58.257 --> 07:01.217
Eat of it and heal your wounds.

07:01.337 --> 07:04.257
Have mercy on us.
Be our savior once again.

07:04.387 --> 07:05.217
Please!

07:06.257 --> 07:09.387
(indistinct whispering)

07:11.087 --> 07:13.507
(Woman whimpering)

07:16.587 --> 07:19.177
(Amagi groans)

07:20.337 --> 07:22.427
The elder's judgment
had been unerring.

07:24.087 --> 07:26.547
Thanks to the sacrifice
of one person,

07:26.677 --> 07:29.257
a village teetering on the edge
of extinction was saved.

07:29.967 --> 07:31.717
They survived
because they poured

07:31.837 --> 07:34.387
the entirety of their faith
into me and my power.

07:36.047 --> 07:37.547
Koga may think
that I'm a monster,

07:38.007 --> 07:40.297
but he's sorely mistaken.

07:40.427 --> 07:43.087
I'm the true essence
of mononoke.

07:44.137 --> 07:46.467
The name mononoke
shall no longer be used

07:46.587 --> 07:48.757
for the unhuman multitude.

07:48.887 --> 07:52.427
The name shall be reserved
for the almighty Amagi alone.

07:52.547 --> 07:54.507
The one who sits
atop the throne.

07:54.637 --> 07:57.587
The one who will guide
the unknowing to the just.

07:58.047 --> 08:01.507
I, and I alone, shall define
what a true mononoke is.

08:01.967 --> 08:04.007
(♪ eerie tense music)

08:04.137 --> 08:05.427
[Shiba] This is Shiba.

08:05.547 --> 08:08.007
Prep the medics.
We may have a patient.

08:08.137 --> 08:11.257
Well? Can he control
Rago's power now?

08:11.507 --> 08:13.507
[Ibuki] (sighs) I'm afraid
it's a lost cause.

08:14.047 --> 08:15.087
To expect a human

08:15.217 --> 08:17.547
to learn to control
a mononoke's power that fast,

08:18.007 --> 08:20.177
let alone Rago's spectral
energy, is just...

08:20.887 --> 08:23.217
That said, he might manage
to wield the power

08:23.337 --> 08:24.507
for thirty minutes or so.

08:24.637 --> 08:28.297
In real-world combat, it's
likely less than half that time.

08:28.427 --> 08:32.507
So really, ten minutes at best
or maybe even less.

08:32.637 --> 08:35.007
[Toshimasa] And if he tries to
use the power for longer?

08:35.137 --> 08:36.217
What happens then?

08:36.337 --> 08:38.587
Most likely, he'll
flip out and go berserk.

08:39.047 --> 08:41.637
Or he could turn into some
kind of inhuman being.

08:41.757 --> 08:44.507
Or his body could give
out. Or his heart stop.

08:44.967 --> 08:47.467
All of the possibilities
mean extreme danger for him.

08:47.587 --> 08:49.387
-(Jiro groans) -Jiro!

08:49.507 --> 08:51.387
[Jiro] Oh, so the head honcho

08:51.507 --> 08:53.507
finally decides to show up, huh?

08:53.797 --> 08:56.507
I know. My apologies
for being so late.

08:58.217 --> 08:59.837
[Jiro] Did you tell
'em yet, Ibuki?

08:59.967 --> 09:00.887
[Ibuki] Hm.

09:01.297 --> 09:02.547
All right, then.

09:03.177 --> 09:04.297
I'm sorry, Gramps.

09:05.547 --> 09:08.007
(groans) I really fought
like hell in there,

09:08.137 --> 09:09.507
but it just wasn't enough.

09:09.967 --> 09:11.047
[Toshimasa] Jiro...

09:11.427 --> 09:13.427
But regardless,

09:13.547 --> 09:15.587
I'm still not gonna
sit this one out.

09:16.177 --> 09:19.177
I swear, I'm gonna save Rago

09:19.297 --> 09:21.177
and then I'm gonna bash
that Amagi's face in.

09:22.087 --> 09:23.007
Uh, you're gonna what?

09:23.137 --> 09:25.507
Yeah, yeah, I know.
I remember what you said.

09:25.967 --> 09:27.507
I'm still just half a man.

09:27.967 --> 09:29.087
You know,

09:29.217 --> 09:32.297
I thought I'd figure out a way
to finish this on my own.

09:32.677 --> 09:35.007
It took a while to get
through my thick skull,

09:35.137 --> 09:36.547
but I finally got it.

09:37.007 --> 09:38.007
I'm ready to admit

09:38.137 --> 09:40.387
that I can't dig myself
out of this hole alone.

09:41.927 --> 09:44.887
So, what do you say
then, you guys?

09:45.637 --> 09:49.137
You think maybe
you could help me out?

09:49.257 --> 09:52.717
(♪ bright gentle music)

09:56.047 --> 09:58.007
[Shiba] Yeah,
I think we can do that.

10:00.967 --> 10:03.257
Well, it's time for us to
go. The forest awaits.

10:03.927 --> 10:06.257
It pains me to say goodbye.

10:06.387 --> 10:07.587
I'm sorry, but the old pact

10:07.717 --> 10:09.257
about leaving me
alone still stands.

10:09.387 --> 10:11.257
Nothing to apologize for.

10:11.387 --> 10:13.717
You guys helped me out more
than you know.

10:13.837 --> 10:16.587
Show me how far that hot
tempered swagger can take you.

10:17.387 --> 10:18.967
I have high hopes for you, Jiro.

10:19.087 --> 10:19.797
Thank you.

10:26.007 --> 10:27.137
USAMI

10:27.217 --> 10:28.297
<i>[Shiba] I'm here.</i>

10:28.427 --> 10:30.297
[Hana] Chief! Oh,
thank heavens it's you!

10:30.427 --> 10:32.177
[Shiba] Why, what's going on?

10:32.297 --> 10:34.507
[Hana] Oh, for Pete's sake!
Please, just hurry back!

10:34.967 --> 10:35.927
As fast as you can!

10:38.007 --> 10:40.007
NOTICE
SERVICE SUSPENDED

10:41.467 --> 10:44.337
[Agent] All right. I'm looking
over the map of the area.

10:44.467 --> 10:45.837
Director Kusumi?

10:47.297 --> 10:49.337
Roads in and out of
the area are closed,

10:49.467 --> 10:50.927
so we should be good to go.

10:51.047 --> 10:52.177
Nice work.

10:52.297 --> 10:54.387
All right, next up,
spread the cover story

10:54.507 --> 10:56.467
and make sure witnesses
forget everything.

10:56.587 --> 10:57.967
[Banjuro] Right away, ma'am.

10:59.177 --> 11:00.677
Well, I'll be.

11:00.797 --> 11:02.467
They certainly don't
seem to be worried

11:02.587 --> 11:04.427
about keeping a low profile.

11:05.217 --> 11:07.797
That takes balls, setting up
shop right in front of our HQ.

11:10.507 --> 11:12.927
But why? Why choose this site?

11:13.387 --> 11:15.467
My guess is they wanted
to make it impossible

11:15.587 --> 11:16.927
for us to miss them.

11:17.217 --> 11:19.047
And it also makes
it easier for them

11:19.177 --> 11:20.467
to drag Jiro out of here.

11:21.467 --> 11:24.547
-Sure is nice to be wanted.
-(♪ mellow music)

11:24.677 --> 11:27.467
I was planning on busting
into their place anyway.

11:27.587 --> 11:30.297
And better here than around
innocent people in the city.

11:30.427 --> 11:32.257
Oh, you found some new
Espionage Gear, huh?

11:32.387 --> 11:33.677
Yeah, sure did.

11:33.797 --> 11:37.087
That trusty ol' Tokieda got
me a new set right away.

11:37.217 --> 11:38.637
It's not some track
suit, you know.

11:39.087 --> 11:41.337
Do you have any idea how
much this stuff cost?

11:41.467 --> 11:43.587
I expect they're
kind of pricey.

11:44.047 --> 11:46.217
Let's see, a get-up like yours,

11:46.337 --> 11:49.467
I'd say it's about the cost
of a current-gen fighter jet.

11:49.587 --> 11:50.677
You've gotta be kidding!

11:50.797 --> 11:53.047
Just how much are we
talking about here?

11:53.177 --> 11:56.007
[Reiji] Think hard.
Try using your imagination.

11:56.137 --> 11:57.217
(Hana giggles)

11:57.337 --> 11:59.547
They're ten billion yen.
At the very least.

12:00.137 --> 12:01.087
[Jiro] Reiji!

12:01.547 --> 12:03.427
Sorry to keep you guys waiting.

12:03.547 --> 12:06.387
Anyway, Reiji Kirihara,
reporting back for duty.

12:07.297 --> 12:09.007
You're all healed up, I see.

12:09.137 --> 12:10.297
That's right.

12:10.587 --> 12:12.337
The human body can work miracles

12:12.467 --> 12:14.007
when there's a beautiful
face waiting.

12:15.177 --> 12:16.337
Ten billion...

12:16.467 --> 12:17.427
(Roren yells)

12:17.547 --> 12:19.637
Hey, what do you
think you're doing?

12:20.087 --> 12:22.047
Yeah, you there, filthy human!

12:22.177 --> 12:24.177
Stay away from my bride!
Do you hear me?

12:24.297 --> 12:25.047
[Fuyo] Give it a rest!

12:25.427 --> 12:27.467
What in the world is going on?

12:27.587 --> 12:30.337
Uh, yeah, we've
been pretty busy.

12:30.467 --> 12:32.547
He's helping us out
by using his spectral barrier

12:33.007 --> 12:34.547
to keep this area
blocked off and safe.

12:35.007 --> 12:37.337
[Reiji] I kinda get the
impression that he's not

12:37.467 --> 12:39.467
helping out of the
goodness of his heart.

12:39.587 --> 12:41.467
All right, on a different note,

12:41.587 --> 12:44.007
at least the team
is back together now!

12:44.137 --> 12:46.717
You know, let's have a party
for Reiji's return.

12:47.177 --> 12:49.637
Maybe a little later. It's
not the best time for a party.

12:50.087 --> 12:51.547
Well, I'll be
looking forward to it

12:52.007 --> 12:53.637
when this is all over
and done with.

12:54.087 --> 12:55.217
(Jiro groans)

12:55.337 --> 12:58.337
Hey, Jiro, we were finally
starting to act like a team

12:58.467 --> 12:59.837
and you're ruining it!

12:59.967 --> 13:01.507
Oh, sorry.

13:01.637 --> 13:04.007
It's just, those
bug looking things

13:04.137 --> 13:05.507
are kinda freaking me out.

13:05.637 --> 13:07.257
[Onmitsu Member] What's that?

13:07.387 --> 13:09.047
Grab your guns, fellas.
It's time!

13:10.257 --> 13:12.087
On your knees!
Get your hands up!

13:12.337 --> 13:14.837
(Koga sighs) You human scum.

13:16.467 --> 13:18.587
(gasps) Wait, that guy?

13:18.927 --> 13:20.257
Koga?

13:20.387 --> 13:22.007
Jiro Azuma.

13:29.047 --> 13:30.637
[Onmitsu Member]
Hey, freeze! Stop!

13:33.177 --> 13:34.547
-(Koga growls)
-(Jiro growls)

13:35.007 --> 13:36.507
[Jiro] Listen, I don't
know why you're here

13:36.967 --> 13:39.257
but I don't have the time
to entertain you right now.

13:40.137 --> 13:42.467
If you wanna spar,
come back some other time.

13:43.217 --> 13:44.007
(Koga growls)

13:45.007 --> 13:46.467
Still, I can tell you

13:46.587 --> 13:48.137
that's just the kind
of person he is.

13:48.387 --> 13:49.387
(Koga grunts)

13:51.387 --> 13:53.337
(Jiro grunts) Hey, jerk-off!

13:53.467 --> 13:56.217
[Koga] Shut up.
We need to talk.

13:56.337 --> 13:57.257
Come here, dipshit.

14:00.177 --> 14:01.637
[Toko] Cannibalism?

14:01.757 --> 14:05.047
To think that Amagi was
sitting on so much power.

14:05.177 --> 14:07.217
[Jiro] That guy is just
straight up pure evil.

14:08.217 --> 14:10.087
The only ones left
on the other side

14:10.217 --> 14:11.587
are Amagi and Rago, right?

14:12.467 --> 14:14.217
Hey, I'm talking to you!

14:14.337 --> 14:15.637
Why are you here?

14:16.087 --> 14:17.547
What's with this freak?

14:17.887 --> 14:20.547
[Shiba] I get the sense that
he's telling the truth.

14:20.677 --> 14:23.387
And he probably doesn't have
a clue what to do next, either.

14:23.507 --> 14:25.427
[Toko] In any case,
I think we can assume

14:25.547 --> 14:27.587
they won't ambush us elsewhere.

14:27.717 --> 14:30.467
I want to focus our personnel
here. With additional-

14:30.587 --> 14:32.467
Director Kusumi,
we've got trouble!

14:32.587 --> 14:34.587
-(guns firing)
-Fire, fire, fire!

14:37.007 --> 14:38.217
Stay strong, guys!

14:38.337 --> 14:39.297
You read me, Director?

14:39.427 --> 14:41.837
There's a bug swarm
on the harbor's west side.

14:42.087 --> 14:43.507
(bug crashes)

14:43.967 --> 14:46.047
We've engaged
but can't hold them off!

14:46.177 --> 14:47.177
<i>We need backup!</i>

14:48.047 --> 14:50.007
<i>Inui reporting</i>
<i>from the eastern front.</i>

14:50.137 --> 14:52.507
<i>We're trying to hold them back</i>
<i>but it's an uphill battle.</i>

14:52.637 --> 14:54.087
<i>They're pouring</i>
<i>in from the gate!</i>

14:54.217 --> 14:56.047
(Inui grunts)

14:56.177 --> 14:58.547
They're pretty weak on
their own, but there's too many.

14:59.007 --> 15:01.007
If this keeps up,
some will get through.

15:01.137 --> 15:03.637
If they get past us, they could
easily breach the barrier!

15:04.507 --> 15:07.387
[Onmitsu Member] It's like
they're coming from both gates.

15:07.757 --> 15:09.717
It won't be long
before they head this way.

15:10.427 --> 15:13.137
What now? Do we fight 'em off?

15:13.547 --> 15:15.507
Of course. That's
just what we'll do.

15:16.387 --> 15:19.257
But remember, the clock
is ticking on your power.

15:19.387 --> 15:21.337
We can't afford to have
you use it all up here.

15:22.137 --> 15:24.467
You've gotta go through
and find Amagi.

15:24.587 --> 15:27.467
Now, Ichika and Reiji,
get Jiro there.

15:27.587 --> 15:29.467
Make sure he reaches
the gate in one piece.

15:29.927 --> 15:31.427
You got it, Boss, but-

15:31.547 --> 15:33.297
How are we all supposed
to get out there?

15:33.427 --> 15:35.507
-(Fuyo laughs)
-Well, well!

15:35.967 --> 15:38.087
I finally get to
have fun. You ready?

15:38.587 --> 15:40.507
Uh, just how
worried should I be?

15:40.967 --> 15:42.547
(Fuyo scoffs) Who do
you think I am?

15:43.467 --> 15:45.927
I'm an immortal
being with inhuman powers.

15:46.047 --> 15:47.257
I'm a mononoke!

15:48.587 --> 15:50.757
Taking two or three
pathetic humans

15:51.217 --> 15:53.587
and making 'em float like
butterflies is a piece of cake.

15:54.047 --> 15:55.337
-(Jiro yells)
-(Reiji shudders)

15:55.467 --> 15:57.387
I'm really floating!

15:57.507 --> 16:00.047
I'll make sure that
you guys stay in the air,

16:00.177 --> 16:02.387
but it's up to you to
decide where you go.

16:02.507 --> 16:03.717
[Shiba] All right, Jiro.

16:04.637 --> 16:06.637
You're our last shot
to stop Amagi.

16:07.387 --> 16:09.427
Hit him with everything
that you've got.

16:09.547 --> 16:11.257
But save it till you're
through the gate.

16:11.387 --> 16:12.967
Trust the others.
They'll have your back.

16:13.087 --> 16:14.587
Right. Got it.

16:14.717 --> 16:17.087
[Shiba] Ichika,
Reiji, keep him safe.

16:17.467 --> 16:18.547
-Got it.
-Got it.

16:19.007 --> 16:20.047
All right.

16:20.177 --> 16:21.467
Go get him.

16:21.927 --> 16:24.587
(♪ upbeat bold music)

16:28.087 --> 16:30.587
(guns firing)

16:32.547 --> 16:33.507
Damn it!

16:36.217 --> 16:37.507
(bug explodes)

16:37.637 --> 16:39.297
Honestly.

16:39.427 --> 16:41.427
You boys needed this old
retiree's help

16:41.547 --> 16:42.547
more than I thought.

16:43.137 --> 16:44.507
Now go on!

16:44.637 --> 16:46.007
Get back out there, kid.

16:47.087 --> 16:48.547
-(Toshimasa grunts)
-Yes, sir!

16:51.427 --> 16:53.177
You better not make
this dinosaur

16:53.297 --> 16:54.967
outlive his grandson, Jiro.

16:55.587 --> 16:58.637
(♪ upbeat tense music)

17:03.217 --> 17:05.087
-(Ichika yells)
-(bug explodes)

17:05.217 --> 17:07.217
Hey, what are you doing?

17:07.337 --> 17:08.637
It's not the time
for daydreaming.

17:09.087 --> 17:11.297
Get it in gear
and keep your ass moving!

17:11.427 --> 17:12.507
(Jiro growls)

17:13.177 --> 17:14.637
Well, you're a joy
to work with.

17:15.087 --> 17:16.087
-Hey, watch out!
-Huh?

17:21.087 --> 17:22.507
You're not hurt,
are you, Ichika?

17:23.137 --> 17:24.047
Please be careful.

17:24.177 --> 17:27.217
Our mission's to deliver
this baggage unharmed,

17:27.337 --> 17:28.467
but take care of yourself too.

17:28.927 --> 17:30.427
[Jiro] Hey, the baggage
has ears!

17:30.547 --> 17:32.637
Damn it. This whole keeping
my hands to myself thing

17:33.087 --> 17:34.507
really bites the big one!

17:34.637 --> 17:36.507
Well if you ask me,
it's a good chance

17:36.967 --> 17:39.177
for you to learn
from self-restraint.

17:39.297 --> 17:41.467
We're close. We're almost
at our destination.

17:42.337 --> 17:43.547
They just keep coming,

17:43.677 --> 17:44.797
no matter how many
we swat down.

17:44.927 --> 17:47.677
Trying to go after them
all will only put us at risk.

17:47.797 --> 17:50.507
Here's what we'll do. Lure as
many away from you as we can.

17:50.637 --> 17:52.217
You focus on getting
to that gate

17:52.337 --> 17:54.047
as fast as possible, Jiro.

17:54.587 --> 17:56.467
We'll draw them higher
and keep them busy.

17:56.927 --> 17:59.047
Don't get surrounded.
Stay close to the water.

17:59.717 --> 18:01.507
That way you can skim
right under them.

18:01.637 --> 18:04.177
-(Jiro grunts)
-Hey, look out!

18:04.297 --> 18:06.757
(Ichika yells)

18:07.967 --> 18:09.927
Are you sure you're
gonna be okay?

18:11.047 --> 18:11.757
Naturally.

18:13.297 --> 18:15.137
Losing isn't an option!

18:15.677 --> 18:17.717
I haven't forgotten
about you, Mom.

18:20.337 --> 18:21.387
[Reiji] I can't quit.

18:21.507 --> 18:23.087
I've still got a
score to settle.

18:24.467 --> 18:29.177
-(Ichika grunts)
-(Reiji and Ichika yelling)

18:30.007 --> 18:31.797
(bugs exploding)

18:32.047 --> 18:33.217
(Jiro gasps)

18:34.007 --> 18:36.177
There, you see?
Just leave this to us.

18:36.297 --> 18:38.047
(Jiro chuckles)

18:38.177 --> 18:40.297
As long as you don't
die, have at 'em.

18:40.427 --> 18:43.297
I should be the one saying
that to you, loser.

18:43.427 --> 18:45.387
The clock is ticking. Let's go.

18:48.217 --> 18:51.047
(water splashes)

18:51.177 --> 18:54.087
(bug screeches)

18:54.217 --> 18:56.427
Gotta use some of this power.

18:57.337 --> 18:59.467
-(Koga yells)
-(bug explodes)

19:01.387 --> 19:02.257
(Jiro gasps)

19:03.047 --> 19:04.337
Koga?

19:04.467 --> 19:05.717
But why are you here?

19:07.297 --> 19:08.587
Hey, wait!

19:11.047 --> 19:11.927
(bug explodes)

19:12.047 --> 19:12.927
No way, you.

19:14.007 --> 19:15.087
(Koga grunts)

19:15.217 --> 19:16.387
(Jiro groans)

19:19.337 --> 19:20.297
(Jiro chuckles)

19:27.177 --> 19:29.757
(bugs screeching)

19:31.637 --> 19:34.297
(Jiro grunting)

19:43.547 --> 19:46.467
So you're here, and injury free.

19:46.587 --> 19:48.467
You're more competent
than I thought.

19:48.587 --> 19:51.137
I've been waiting
for you, Jiro Azuma.

19:51.257 --> 19:52.547
(Rago gasps) Jiro.

19:53.087 --> 19:53.837
[Jiro] Hey, Rago.

19:53.967 --> 19:56.007
You're looking pretty
cozy in there.

19:56.137 --> 19:57.337
[Rago] It's just a cat bed.

19:57.467 --> 19:59.467
Don't blow a gasket, okay?

19:59.587 --> 20:02.007
I'll get you outta there
in no time.

20:02.137 --> 20:04.427
(Rago chuckles)

20:05.547 --> 20:08.967
Amagi, you'd eat an ally,
you sick bastard?

20:09.087 --> 20:10.587
Foolish question.

20:10.717 --> 20:14.757
Would you fire 100 tiny bullets
or one devastating missile?

20:14.887 --> 20:17.047
Concentrating one's power
into a single weapon's

20:17.177 --> 20:19.047
much more effective.

20:19.177 --> 20:21.137
[Jiro] You really do hate
humans, don't you?

20:23.637 --> 20:26.047
[Amagi] I no longer harbor
hatred,

20:26.177 --> 20:27.507
but the weak of this world

20:27.637 --> 20:29.087
shouldn't rule
over the powerful.

20:29.217 --> 20:30.507
That's bullshit.

20:30.967 --> 20:32.257
It's logical.

20:32.387 --> 20:35.427
(♪ uptempo tense music)

20:37.427 --> 20:39.547
Like my fancy new camo?

20:40.007 --> 20:43.177
I may be a weak human,
but I've still got some juice.

20:43.297 --> 20:45.297
Enough to realign
that smug jaw of yours.

20:45.427 --> 20:48.337
(Amagi spits) Infantile.

20:48.467 --> 20:50.427
Relying on gadgets and baubles

20:50.547 --> 20:52.837
is something that only
a true weakling does.

20:52.967 --> 20:54.047
(Jiro yells)

20:54.177 --> 20:57.637
Utterly pathetic.
Completely disgraceful.

20:59.297 --> 21:01.757
Disgusting sideshow.

21:01.887 --> 21:04.507
The power I seek doesn't come
from ornamentation.

21:04.967 --> 21:06.427
-(Jiro grunts) -Rago!

21:07.007 --> 21:09.217
I'm gonna dip into that power,
but just a little!

21:10.427 --> 21:13.297
(♪ uptempo tense music)

21:17.967 --> 21:18.837
[Amagi] Oh?

21:18.967 --> 21:21.177
So you actually managed
to learn something

21:21.297 --> 21:23.137
in a few days time?

21:23.257 --> 21:26.297
Found someone willing
to teach you a few tricks, huh?

21:26.427 --> 21:28.387
[Jiro] Sorry.
No time for small talk.

21:28.507 --> 21:30.677
I think we oughta just skip
to the main attraction!

21:33.297 --> 21:35.717
-(rubble blasts)
-(Rago groans)

21:38.257 --> 21:41.217
(Jiro breathing heavily)

21:41.637 --> 21:43.587
(Amagi laughs)

21:44.047 --> 21:46.467
[Amagi] Ah, the
rush of nostalgia.

21:46.927 --> 21:48.717
It's been centuries
since I've tasted

21:48.837 --> 21:52.337
and felt that luxurious power
flowing through my veins.

21:52.467 --> 21:54.297
You've exceeded my expectations,

21:54.427 --> 21:57.467
even my imagination, Jiro Azuma.

21:58.217 --> 22:00.717
Granted, it means
a little more work

22:01.967 --> 22:04.337
but strangely I find
it quite appealing.

22:05.297 --> 22:06.637
Now, then,

22:08.047 --> 22:09.217
prepare yourself.

22:09.337 --> 22:11.927
I shall battle you with
both body and soul.

22:14.007 --> 22:16.387
(♪ "I Don't Like Mondays"
by Groooovy)

22:16.507 --> 22:19.257
The number you have dialed
is not available at present.

22:19.387 --> 22:20.637
Please leave your message.

22:22.047 --> 22:26.797
(♪ singing in Japanese)
